Ask the caller about these information. The caller only needs to answer at least one of these but they can answer more than one:

1. Unit Number – Unit number of their vehicle.
2. Unit Nickname – Nickname of their unit/ vehicle.
3. License Plate (Number) - The vehicle's license plate number.
4. Chassis Type – The chassis type of the unit.

